  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759584,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 14 (Commodore 64) - Synopsis\n\nTake to the skies in *14*, a thrilling flight combat simulator for the Commodore 64! Piloting the iconic F-14 Tomcat, you'll experience the adrenaline rush of aerial warfare in a variety of intense scenarios. Choose your path: engage in quick, single-battle skirmishes or embark on a challenging career mode, rising through the ranks as a skilled fighter pilot.\n\nThe game faithfully recreates the F-14's impressive capabilities, allowing you to master its variable-sweep wings and powerful weaponry. Face off against enemy fighters and ground targets in detailed environments, demanding precision flying and tactical decision-making.  Experience realistic physics and stunning (for the C64!) graphics as you dogfight your way to victory. \n\nWhether you're a seasoned flight sim enthusiast or a newcomer to the genre, *14* offers an immersive and exciting experience. Prepare for takeoff and become the ultimate ace!"
    },
